        },
        {
          "text": "Nĩvo ĩndĩ Ulamu mũsumbĩ wa Tile wamũsũngĩie na valũa, ũla wamũtwaĩe Solomoni, Nĩkwĩthĩwa Yeova nũmendete andũ make, nũkũtw’ĩte mũsumbĩ woo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
